{"key":"6bc7cabe0ab707df","source_file":"Potts Se.json","source_id":6595,"source_url":"concordance-sect-ppl-secta","term":"Sect","headwords":["Sect","Sectary"],"latin":["Secta","Sectarius"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Sect"],"latin":["Secta"]},{"english":["Sectary"],"latin":["Sectarius"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["AC","AE","AR","CL","LJCont","SE"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"337","subsection":null},"text":"The heresies and sects (of the Most Ancient Church). Treated of.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"6222","subsection":"2"},"text":"Everyone (of these heresies) is confirmed by the sectaries from the literal sense...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"LJCont","section":"72","subsection":"2"},"text":"(Christians make the soul like wind); but those not of this sect believe (quite differently).","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AR","section":"0","subsection":null},"text":"Preface. 11a. (Christian sects enumerated.) TCR 378:2. (Their cause.)","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AR","section":"224","subsection":"2"},"text":"When we have spoken with... sectaries, they appeared [equally] learned.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"5","subsection":null},"text":"In others they spoke of ecclesiastical things and sects.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"6043","subsection":"2"},"text":"Their sensation was from Spirits of the same sect.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"6043","subsection":"3"},"text":"Those who secede from their sect, they want to kill.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AE","section":"1177","subsection":"3"},"text":"(Why there are so many sects and religions.)","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"sect","url":"/meta/potts/sect/"}